<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up mostly $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up mostly $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts traded mostly $0.50 higher. Demand was moderate to light. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 50.00-51.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
